# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. REPRODUCES CURRENT PRODUCTION (#4485):
# nothing stops decisions while the shards are captured one after another, so
# each shard is captured at its own moment. A shard captured before the saga
# decided holds it pre-saga, one captured after its terminal post-saga.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentShardsCapturedApart
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: no decision gate is raised, so shards are captured apart while decisions land (#4485)
PERTURBS: GateAcquire

--- FIND
    /\ lease' = [lease EXCEPT ![T] = "gate"]
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![T] = TRUE]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no gate is raised.
    /\ UNCHANGED lease
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![T] = TRUE]
--- END
